{"ref":"BDB, אַזְכָּרָה²","hw":"אַזְכָּרָה²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַזְכָּרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. memorial-offering</strong>, only P <strong>(</strong>an Aramaic inf. form; cf. Ba<sup>NB 90</sup> Sta<sup>§ 244</sup><strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.7\">Lv 24:7</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַזְכָּֽרָתָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.2\">Lv 2:2</a> + 5 times;—used of the frankincense burned for the shew-bread <span dir=\"rtl\">והיתה ללחם לאז׳ אִשֶּׁה לי׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.7\">Lv 24:7</a>; elsewhere always after <span dir=\"rtl\">הקטיר</span>, only c. sf., referring to <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנְחָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.2\">Lv 2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.8\">6:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:26\" href=\"/Numbers.5.26\">Nu 5:26</a>; of the meal used as <span dir=\"rtl\">חַטָּאת</span> by the very poor <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.12\">Lv 5:12</a>; always connected with <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשֶּׁה</span>, except <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.8\">Lv 6:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:26\" href=\"/Numbers.5.26\">Nu 5:26</a>.","next":"BDB, מַזְכִּיר","prev":"BDB, זְכַרְיָהוּ"}